              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "adapter — \"to adapt (mostly reflexive, s'adapter)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Les enfants s'adaptent vite à une nouvelle école. Children adapt quickly to a new school."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly reflexive: s'adapter à — to adapt to. Adapter un livre — to adapt a book for the screen."
            }
          ]
        },
